      "created_at": "2016-02-06T19:04:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you! Most of my skill comes from practice - you could definitely get there. :) The trickiest aspect is plotting things out beforehand, to make sure that I fit everything into the map. (Lots of people over on the Cartographers' Guild use GIMP or Photoshop, and so can move objects around after the fact. I made that harder on myself by drawing by hand.)</p>",
