      "created_at": "2018-09-08T04:50:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I realized I haven’t shared a map with this community in a while. I recently finished a cool one for a Cartographers’ Guild challenge - we had to make two maps of a place, showing it in different seasons. I decided to make a Myst/Riven type island for a hermit’s steampunky workshop.</p>\n<p><div class=\"large-image-placeholder\"><a href=\"https://www.cartographersguild.com/attachment.php?attachmentid=109608&amp;d=1534616895\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"url\">https://www.cartographersguild.com/attachment.php?attachmentid=109608&amp;d=1534616895</span><span class=\"help\">(image larger than 4096KB)</span></a></div></p>\n<p>Every now and then I think of doing Insula Primalis…this might be a cool style.</p>",
