      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I realized I haven't shared a map with this community in a while. I recently finished a cool one for a Cartographers' Guild challenge - we had to make two maps of a place, showing it in different seasons. I decided to make a Myst/Riven type island for a hermit's steampunky workshop.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[Img]https://www.cartographersguild.com/attachment.php?attachmentid=109608&d=1534616895[/img]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEvery now and then I think of doing Insula Primalis...this might be a cool style.",
